{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "15f39f68a9ac703cf9617710c4d3540fd6fc9884532cd17b8c1af81e905ff769", "ja": "真昼の太陽", "zh": "正午的太阳", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f2164c342635b5c7221a1badb230fae5acd381d5810404e01401ee36c5caed05", "ja": "ツアー公演の第2弾\n『ShineLight』公演が始動！\n前回公演のメンバー達から託された『アレ』\nを見たアイドル達はやる気を見せ、みんなで\nスローガンを決める事に。", "zh": "巡演公演第2弹\n『ShineLight』公演启动！\n偶像们看到了上次公演成员们托付的『那个』\n都干劲十足，决定一起制定口号。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4b4336f4319d602792a6106902ea221cb656a8c83fe68c6ab8bf81927e564c40", "ja": "（早速、CLEVER CLOVERとLOVERS HEARTの\nメンバーに集まってもらって、概要を聞いてもらった）", "zh": "（我马上召集了CLEVER CLOVER和LOVERS HEART的成员，让她们听了活动概要。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "fc3f1d143e178d67a5bf5f622f93a1e3190d6c0a0d0bb0d7ba80a58bd5e13781", "ja": "前回の『RisingLight』公演、本当に凄かったわ！\n私たち、あれを超えなくちゃいけないのよね……。", "zh": "上次的《RisingLight》公演，真的太精彩了！\n我们必须超越那场演出才行呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "46874cb86831a4c44156fe4025fc8553c823b426f4087276ecd716296460c0ce", "ja": "このみさん、気合い入ってますね？　ふふっ。\nそうですよね。引き継ぐだけじゃなくて、超えなきゃ。", "zh": "木实姐，干劲十足嘛？呵呵。  \n是啊。不能只是继承，还必须超越才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "945ad1137a40c03ade6aa78654a97e88148681ddf0b46307204aeea32ca4b2df", "ja": "私も、いつになく燃えています！　みんなから\n託された『アレ』、見ちゃいましたから。", "zh": "我也比平时更燃了！因为我已经看到了大家托付给我的『那个』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6e56d58cfa4f19ee18e78e9d940b48c218df7c7a5fc7c6a0b52d095a6f11e167", "ja": "アレ？　……ああ、前公演のメンバーが考えてくれた\nヤツか。見せてもらってないんだよな……。", "zh": "那个？……啊，你说的是上场公演的成员们想出来的那个吧。我还没看过呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "68935b2e448f6526d84a595648e46cff6b229c3517f0dbe12396c12f745d3ee7", "ja": "みんな、もう見たのか？　どんなものなんだ？", "zh": "你们已经看过了吗？是什么样的东西啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "fd549ee838860e8efc171b620aac00c035d066d3629a48af070f4eda4574d3b0", "ja": "ダメですよ～、{$P$}！\nまだ内緒なんですから。ふふっ。", "zh": "不行哦～，{$P$}！\n还要保密呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9d7bd74da3db94bfedce85e2e7d9c7a41850b03ffc32f1314d00160f31b81643", "ja": "むぅ。", "zh": "唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "e39a0fcb978a21b107b21243f21ca7b609283e5e3a156e752a0571145bb3623b", "ja": "楽しみにしていてくださいね？　ふふっ♪\nそれに、公演も頑張りますから！", "zh": "请期待一下哦？　呵呵♪\n而且，我也会努力参加演出的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "46130762650126c05d8f06ca86c99e0fb11008c291940d48df4c92fee57acf75", "ja": "うんうん、頑張ろうね♪\n{$P$}さんには内緒で。しーっ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，要加油哦♪\n可要瞒着{$P$}先生。嘘——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f99b96cdc7b40349d753084b54d748c7c32024199832494a2ebe5f3d8d28a412", "ja": "いや、そこは別に内緒じゃなくていいよ。\n隠さないで、堂々と頑張ってくれ！", "zh": "不，那里倒也不用保密啦。\n不用藏着掖着，堂堂正正地加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "0ea14dbbe6988e0fb17feb44a8910854e241561bd3c59e0e5b27bf441d33fe4a", "ja": "そうだネ！　\nワタシたちだって、負けられないナ～。", "zh": "没错！\n我们也不能输呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "acbd9dc0e414aaab4ba82650cc3ec32882f21407e19de7697ba6a2778f2c8680", "ja": "ふふっ、エレナちゃんもやる気満々だね♪\nでも、負けないためには、どうしたらいいのかな～？", "zh": "呵呵，艾蕾娜也干劲十足呢♪  \n不过，要怎样才能不输呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "9025d1e9acfd3a34bf5f66d5b132b11fa2ef5f5611375eae84fc0db985b65ba1", "ja": "そうね……スローガンを決めるのはどうかしら？\n具体的で、わかりやすいやつを。", "zh": "是啊……定个口号怎么样？\n要具体、易懂的那种。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "9f4064754fd56f1b84dc5516554d2f6e48259516ee7808bf6bbe9240c7e284d6", "ja": "あ、それいいですね！　えっと、例えば……\n「天のいと高き場で燃える太陽、手を掲げれば……」", "zh": "啊，这个不错！呃，比如说……\n“在天之至高处燃烧的太阳，只要举起手来……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "9dddcfe7d5af0d9af217ca3fbd99f2b9a138990a05622744c80325d4193daa11", "ja": "ユリコ～、難しいし、わかりにくいヨ～！", "zh": "百合子～，太难了，也听不懂啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "d2b631a31174f96cd3248c6990b6702c2bd2b4c0ecd97e2c7717d70604756522", "ja": "ええっ……！？\nせ、せめて最後まで言わせてくださいよ～！", "zh": "诶诶……！？\n请、请至少让我把话说完嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "fe5d4e540449ee93360cb8badb7629a7c4be0d5cadcfb2581f9ce35a06ef4975", "ja": "でも、スローガンを決めるのはいいかもしれないな。\nチームとして、目指すものがわかりやすくなるし。", "zh": "不过，定个口号或许也不错。\n这样一来，作为团队要努力的目标也会更明确。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "4b7f554517fc063cf295376836b5f5a0b5436f2611981ae73300a8ebc3084799", "ja": "ShineLight……Shine、輝き……。\n「キラキラより、ギラギラ！」とか、どうかしら？", "zh": "ShineLight……Shine，闪耀……。\n“比起闪闪发光，更要灼灼耀眼！”之类的，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "0b8ee2b379e6f2fc2de2f251ae7bf17171a869a3378f38551efde4549d6a59af", "ja": "へえ！　いいじゃない、律子ちゃん♪\n負けられないって気持ちは、確かにギラギラよね。", "zh": "诶！挺不错的嘛，律子♪\n不想输的心情，确实是闪闪发亮呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "e428e9c8558a54b0d61e0d55eb398bb797f2095c4d7dc7da516ceed79f288f38", "ja": "ウン、すっごくいいと思うヨ！\nみんなでたくさん、ギラギラしちゃお♪", "zh": "嗯，我觉得特别好！\n大家一起尽情闪耀吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "778686c24b621ef761100494e2bbd48fdb288c3773a387d5b94ada7b00e61dcb", "ja": "律子さんのスローガン、いいなぁ……！\n私も、もっといいのを考えなきゃ！　えーっと……。", "zh": "律子姐的口号，真好啊……！\n我也得想个更棒的才行！呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "3764bd3e6c5afd94a53e79617df8163276752f2ec488e5541dfc88a3a360d7cb", "ja": "そこもギラギラしちゃうのね……。", "zh": "连那里也开始闪闪发光了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a8dde4a0e49fbda61ad1821c068772331ec17fb65475b10e25aec4b4bc8971de", "ja": "（みんなの目が、強い輝きを宿し始めている……\nこれはいい公演になりそうだな！）", "zh": "（大家的眼中开始闪耀出强烈的光芒……\n看来会是一场很棒的公演啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
